# Product Category page (locked spec)

Products third tab: Mattex Products | **Product Category** | Mattex Chain Products.

Add / rename / delete. Delete blocked while any product (including soft-deleted) still uses that category. Counts include soft-deleted. Select products to move; Add products assigns from the rest of the catalog. One product, one category. Never unassign to empty. Soft-deleted rows are read-only. Product form still has Add category.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD
deleteAdminCategory(id); // while products remain
assignAdminProductsCategory(ids, "");

// ✅ GOOD
<button disabled={category.count > 0}>Delete</button>
assignAdminProductsCategory(ids, otherCategoryName);
```
